cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RedlineDB, please cite this software release."
type: software
title: RedlineDB
version: 5.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-29
abstract: >-
  RedlineDB is an experimental embedded SQL engine written in Rust. It offers a
  SQLite-shaped SQL shell and Rust API over its own storage format, with MVCC
  snapshots, concurrent writers within one process, a group-commit write-ahead
  log and crash recovery. It is not a drop-in replacement for SQLite.
authors:
  - name: "The RedlineDB Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/neverhuman/redline"
url: "https://github.com/neverhuman/redline"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - database
  - embedded database
  - SQL
  - Rust
  - MVCC
  - write-ahead log
